From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] power-menu: The buttons one below the other

Plinius: the power menu (long press on the power button) lists its
buttons in one column instead of two: Power Off (Suspend on the lock
screen), Restart, Restart Phosh, Lock, Screenshot, Emergency and, with a
second account, Log Out. Icon and label start at the left edge, as in a
list.
---
 src/stylesheet/common.css |  2 +-
 src/ui/power-menu.ui      | 33 ++++++++++++++++-----------------
 2 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/stylesheet/common.css b/src/stylesheet/common.css
index e0d831bf..62e7035a 100644
--- a/src/stylesheet/common.css
+++ b/src/stylesheet/common.css
@@ -1333,7 +1333,7 @@ phosh-power-menu .phosh-system-modal-dialog {
   margin: 24px;
 }
 
-/* Plinius: icon and label side by side, rows instead of squares (room for Log Out) */
+/* Plinius: icon and label side by side, one button below the other */
 phosh-power-menu grid button {
   min-height: 52px;
   min-width: 64px;
